{"body": [{"y0": 66.9, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 405.5, "text": "— Latina, in lingua Graeca —. Vocàbula óstium et iànua —"}, {"y0": 80.6, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 405.1, "text": "rem significant; lingua duàs rés — significat. Magister librós"}, {"y0": 94.6, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 272.6, "text": "Latinos et Graecós — potest."}, {"y0": 108.5, "x0": 160.1, "x1": 405.1, "text": "Discipuli hanc — in tabulis suis —: Homo oculos et nàsum"}, {"y0": 122.3, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 405.1, "text": "habet. Magister tabulam — pueri aspicit, et Sexti et Titi et"}, {"y0": 136.4, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.9, "text": "Marci. In tabulà Marci iv litterae —. Magister litterás quae"}, {"y0": 150.4, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.9, "text": "désunt —; — [- eó modo] magister menda Màrci —. Tum"}, {"y0": 164.1, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.0, "text": "Marcus scribit — [7 hoc modo]: HoMo HOCVLOS... Magister:"}, {"y0": 176.3, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.9, "text": "*Ó Marce! Hic nón —, immo — littera H!? Marcus stilum"}, {"y0": 192.2, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.9, "text": "vertens H litteram —. Tum magister calamum et — sümit et"}, {"y0": 206.2, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 266.0, "text": "— ad patrem Márci scribit."}, {"y0": 220.1, "x0": 159.8, "x1": 339.6, "text": "Cera est — mollis. Ferrum est materia —."}, {"y0": 247.8, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 202.4, "text": "PENSVM C"}, {"y0": 261.6, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 263.3, "text": "Quot sunt litterae Latinae?"}, {"y0": 275.5, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 277.7, "text": "Estne D vocalis an cónsonàns?"}, {"y0": 289.5, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 312.4, "text": "Quot syllabàs habet vocabulum *apis'?"}, {"y0": 303.6, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 294.2, "text": "Quomodo parvus discipulus legit?"}, {"y0": 317.3, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 294.0, "text": "Quis discipulus réctissimé scribit?"}, {"y0": 330.9, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 311.3, "text": "Qualés sunt litterae quas Titus scribit?"}, {"y0": 345.2, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 275.9, "text": "Qualis discipulus est Marcus?"}, {"y0": 359.0, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 323.0, "text": "Cür Marcus nón HOMO, sed OMO scribit?"}, {"y0": 372.3, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 295.7, "text": "Quoties Màrcus litteram H scribit?"}, {"y0": 387.1, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 291.9, "text": "Stilone in tabulà scribit magister?"}, {"y0": 400.8, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 243.6, "text": "Quid magister scribit?"}, {"y0": 414.8, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 286.8, "text": "Estne facilis grammatica Latina?"}, {"y0": 428.7, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 298.0, "text": "Tüne réctius scribis quam Márcus?"}], "margin": [{"y0": 67.1, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 69.1, "text": "mollis"}, {"y0": 76.1, "x0": 47.5, "x1": 68.2, "text": "dürus"}, {"y0": 85.1, "x0": 47.5, "x1": 68.7, "text": "qualis"}, {"y0": 94.2, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 61.9, "text": "tális"}, {"y0": 103.2, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 75.4, "text": "impiger"}, {"y0": 112.4, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 74.1, "text": "iungere"}, {"y0": 121.6, "x0": 47.5, "x1": 87.1, "text": "coniungere"}, {"y0": 130.8, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 84.2, "text": "significare"}, {"y0": 139.8, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 68.7, "text": "legere"}, {"y0": 149.0, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 84.5, "text": "intellegere"}, {"y0": 158.0, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 75.5, "text": "scribere"}, {"y0": 167.0, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 71.6, "text": "dictàre"}, {"y0": 176.9, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 85.1, "text": "comparare"}, {"y0": 185.1, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 78.1, "text": "exaudire"}, {"y0": 194.1, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 70.1, "text": "deesse"}, {"y0": 203.7, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 71.4, "text": "addere"}, {"y0": 212.9, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 79.5, "text": "corrigere"}, {"y0": 223.8, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 77.0, "text": "premere"}, {"y0": 230.7, "x0": 47.5, "x1": 73.4, "text": "efficere"}, {"y0": 239.9, "x0": 47.5, "x1": 98.6, "text": "animadvertere"}, {"y0": 250.8, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 81.3, "text": "superesse"}, {"y0": 258.0, "x0": 47.5, "x1": 69.1, "text": "delere"}, {"y0": 267.2, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 72.8, "text": "signare"}, {"y0": 276.2, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 85.3, "text": "imprimere"}, {"y0": 285.6, "x0": 47.3, "x1": 65.3, "text": "idem"}, {"y0": 294.6, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 70.3, "text": "eadem"}, {"y0": 303.8, "x0": 47.8, "x1": 65.1, "text": "idem"